# Text files are checked out with LF everywhere, Windows included.
#
# Without this, git on the Windows CI runner turned every text file into CRLF
# on checkout. Tests that read the source, the changelog or a fixture and look
# for a pattern passed on Linux and failed there, again and again, while the
# program itself was fine. How the app handles a user's own CRLF files is
# covered by tests that build such files themselves.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.syso binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
